      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Seconded. Works great in AltSpace though a couple of newer conference apps use a bit different model: single instance instead of multiple instances with mirrored presenters, but use low-poly minimally tracked placeholders for large crowds of guests and limited localized voice chat distances or little voice circles you can place down. Plus preferences for always showing full avatars for friends. Not sure how that would work in VRChat though, maybe a customizable low-poly placeholder?",
